  ('mayrhofen-austria', '01F', 'Mayrhofen', 'Austria', 'Austria''s steepest piste, a world-class freestyle park, 476 km', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'Austria', '{"ski","adventure","entertainment","family","wellness","culinary"}', '{"alpine","festive","adventurous"}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Two home mountains: Penken (main; Harakiri + Penken Park freestyle) + Ahorn (sunny beginner side; Ahornbahn = Austria''s largest cable car, 160-pax)","Local Mayrhofen area ~142 km / ~60 lifts (blue ~40/red ~66/black ~33); top ~2,500 m; village ~630 m; season ~late Nov-late April","The Harakiri = Austria''s steepest groomed piste (widely reported ~78% / ~38 deg - exact figure to verify; not asserted)","Penken Park = one of Austria''s best freestyle snowparks","Zillertal Superskipass = ~476.3 km / 187 lifts across 7 areas on one ticket (car-free via the Zillertalbahn)","Hintertux Glacier (~20 km up the Tuxertal) = one of only 2 year-round/365-day ski resorts on earth (with Zermatt); 64 km winter, to 3,250 m, longest run ~12 km","Snowbombing = the original mountain music festival, based in Mayrhofen since 2005, each spring (2027 = 5-10 April)","Big apres reputation (Ice Bar, Niki''s Schirmbar among the names - venues to verify)","Reached via Jenbach + the narrow-gauge Zillertalbahn; Innsbruck ~1 hr; Munich/Salzburg airports","No confirmed Ikon/Epic affiliation (own product = Zillertal Superskipass)","Strong 4/5-star hotel base with spas (e.g. Elisabethhotel - ratings to verify)","Heli-skiing NOT available (Austria permits it only at Vorarlberg/Lech-Zurs sites)","Avalanche = Lawinenwarndienst Tirol via Euregio lawinen.report, EAWS 5-level - NOT SLF/Meteo","Nearest hospital = Bezirkskrankenhaus Schwaz (~35 km; verify)","A rare four-season mountain: winter area + freestyle park + spring festival + year-round Hintertux glacier"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 EU general / 140 Bergrettung alpine rescue / 144 ambulance / 133 police / 122 fire","hospital":"Bezirkskrankenhaus Schwaz (~35 km down-valley; verify); local practice for day cases; 140 Bergrettung / helicopter alpine evac","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"Steeps (Harakiri) + freestyle park + off-piste + Hintertux glacier: park-injury discipline (helmet/back protection, feature build-up) + avalanche (Lawinenwarndienst Tirol via lawinen.report, EAWS 5-level; transceiver/shovel/probe + guide off-piste) + crevasse on glacier (roped-and-guided); heli NOT available (Austria = Vorarlberg only); rescue 140 Bergrettung","fcdo":{"posture":"1","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/austria","read":"2026-08-20T14:48:12Z","page_updated":"2026-08-11T10:19:06+01:00","source_country":"austria","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms — plus the Snowbombing festival week (spring)","shoulder":"Early Dec opening + spring (festival + spring skiing); Hintertux glacier covers autumn/summer","green":"May-Jun + Oct-Nov (Hintertux glacier skis year-round); thinner crowds","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + Snowbombing 3-8 mo; regular winter 2-4 mo; glacier/summer 1-3 mo","off_season_specials":"Year-round Hintertux glacier; Snowbombing (April); summer hiking/biking; spring-ski value","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (late Nov-late April), Snowbombing (April), Christmas/NY; glacier summer season","fire_date":"Next winter + freestyle/park weeks by Jun-Sep; Snowbombing from autumn; glacier + summer year-round"},"jewels":[{"name":"Ski Mayrhofen''s ~142 km across the Penken and Ahorn","si_tag":"Winter/Ski","status":"live","tier":"comfort","price_band":"lift pass EUR to confirm; instructor ~EUR 350-550/day (approx)","timing":"ski ~late Nov-late April; verify","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a genuine all-level home area — the freestyle-and-steeps Penken plus the sunny beginn